  "editorial": {
    "name": "Ngx Stripe",
    "descriptionZh": "用 Angular 接 Stripe 收款的库，覆盖 Checkout、Payment Element、Identity、Payment Links 四块。首页只给 Get started 与 Live demo 两条路，文档落在 /docs/installation。",
    "takeawayZh": "在 Angular 里嵌 Stripe 的支付组件",
    "noteZh": "首屏左右两侧各铺一片圆点网格，正中是一枚圆角方块图标，白底上是 Angular 盾牌加一块紫色 S，下面一行 Ngx Stripe 和副标题 Collect payments with Stripe the Angular way，按钮 Get started 与 Live demo 并排。往下是一条整幅紫色带，四个卡片从左到右写着 Checkout、Payment Element、Identity、Payment Links：Checkout 讲用低代码做一个托管在 Stripe 上的定制支付页，Payment Element 是能收全球支付方式的嵌入 UI 组件，Identity 用程序确认全球用户身份，Payment Links 不用网站也能开卖、几步就能生成整页。页脚 Support 段给了 GitHub Create Issue、Twitter Send DM、Mail Send Message 三条联系路径，并写明 Made with love by Ricardo Sánchez。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
